\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O GRANT us light, that we may know
\par The wisdom Thou alone canst give;
\par That truth may guide whe'er we go
\par And virtue bless where'er we live.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. O grant us light, that we may see,
\par Where error lurks in human lore,
\par And turn our doubting minds to Thee,
\par And love Thy simple Word the more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. O grant us light, that we may learn
\par How dead is life from Thee apart;
\par How sure is joy for all who turn
\par To Thee an undevided heart.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O grant us light, in grief and pain,
\par To lift our burdened hearts above,
\par And count the very cross a gain,
\par And bless our Father's hidden love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O grant us light, when soon or late
\par All earthly scenes shall pass away,
\par In Thee to find the open gate
\par To deathless home and endless day.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

